## Plus: companion audit found one more uncovered case

Sub-agent audit of the runtime font-change path found a real gap NOT in the PR:

- v0.32.2 font-size + font-family handlers set the option, then immediately `fit()` — no `document.fonts.load()` await. Switching to a not-yet-loaded font measured fallback cells, atlas rasterized against fallback, FOUT swap-in → smeared tiles.
- Both effects now await the new face inside a 1500 ms-bounded `Promise.race`, mirroring the cold-start await. `cancelled` flag on cleanup aborts a stale wait.

